WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.234 --> 00:00:02.735 line:0%
-Okay, guys.
Here's how the game works.

00:00:02.735 --> 00:00:04.604 line:0%
Liam, you'll start the round by
pressing start on this buzzer,

00:00:04.604 --> 00:00:06.572 line:0%
and then you draw a clue
from the top of the pile.

00:00:06.572 --> 00:00:09.309 line:0%
You have to get your partner
to guess the clue
as quickly as possible

00:00:09.309 --> 00:00:11.944 line:0%
then hand the buzzer off
to the person on your right.

00:00:11.944 --> 00:00:14.680 line:0%
You can make any physical
gesture, say whatever you want,

00:00:14.680 --> 00:00:16.649 line:0%
but you can't say any word
in the actual clue.

00:00:16.649 --> 00:00:18.618 line:0%
If you're holding the buzzer
when it goes off,

00:00:18.618 --> 00:00:20.119 line:0%
your team loses that round.

00:00:20.119 --> 00:00:22.421 line:0%
We'll play three rounds.
Let's take our positions. Ready?

00:00:22.421 --> 00:00:23.789 line:0%
-Yeah.
-Here we go.

00:00:23.789 --> 00:00:25.892 line:0%
Jessica, you're there.
-Okay. Exciting.

00:00:25.892 --> 00:00:28.060 line:0%
-Yeah. And that's you, buddy,
right there.

00:00:28.060 --> 00:00:29.862 line:0%
Are you competitive?
-Yeah, I'm really comp--

00:00:29.862 --> 00:00:32.098 line:0%
I'm a Leo,
so I'm ready to roll whenever.

00:00:32.098 --> 00:00:34.567 line:0%
I can talk crap like anybody.
-Yeah, it looks like you --

00:00:34.567 --> 00:00:37.069 line:0%
-You're the worst. You're the
worst. And we're going to win.

00:00:37.069 --> 00:00:38.371 line:0%
-Oh, my gosh.

00:00:38.371 --> 00:00:40.340 line:0%
-That's the harshest trash talk
I have ever heard.

00:00:40.340 --> 00:00:41.908 line:0%
-Wow. And you play NFL football.

00:00:41.908 --> 00:00:43.843 line:0%
Here we go. All right.
You start off.

00:00:43.843 --> 00:00:46.312 line:0%
You press the buzzer
and then take the first clue.

00:00:46.312 --> 00:00:47.614 line:0%
-All right.
-And best of luck, really.

00:00:47.614 --> 00:00:48.815 line:0%
I really hope
you have a good time.

00:00:48.815 --> 00:00:49.849 line:0%
-Okay.

00:00:49.849 --> 00:00:51.785 line:0%
[ Beeping ]

00:00:51.785 --> 00:00:55.121 line:0%
Opposite of really low
singing voice.

00:00:55.121 --> 00:00:57.390 line:0%
-High, alto, soprano.
Oh, my God.

00:00:57.390 --> 00:00:58.958 line:0%
Falsetto.
-Yeah. There you go.

00:00:58.958 --> 00:01:00.092 line:0%
-Yeah!
-Oh, my gosh.

00:01:00.092 --> 00:01:01.293 line:0%
-Wow.
-All right, go.

00:01:01.293 --> 00:01:02.528 line:0%
-That was good.

00:01:02.528 --> 00:01:03.896 line:0%
-Take this, Gronk.

00:01:03.896 --> 00:01:06.199 line:0%
-You're on the ground, and
you're doing a motion like this.

00:01:06.199 --> 00:01:07.367 line:0%
-The worm.
-Yes, yes!

00:01:07.367 --> 00:01:08.467 line:0%
-Wow!

00:01:08.467 --> 00:01:09.969 line:0%
-He's played before.

00:01:09.969 --> 00:01:12.805 line:0%
-Oh, man. It's a Mexican food.

00:01:12.805 --> 00:01:15.575 line:0%
Not a taco,
but a -- a flat taco.

00:01:15.575 --> 00:01:18.578 line:0%
-A burrito?
-With cheese. No. Oh, man.

00:01:18.578 --> 00:01:20.279 line:0%
-Tortilla.
-Yeah, no!

00:01:20.279 --> 00:01:22.148 line:0%
Oh, but it's wrapped around some
cheese, and you lay it flat.

00:01:22.148 --> 00:01:23.850 line:0%
-Enchilada.
-You lay it flat.

00:01:23.850 --> 00:01:25.184 line:0%
-You lay it flat?
-Yeah.

00:01:25.184 --> 00:01:27.921 line:0%
-What do you lay flat?
-It's like a taco on the side!

00:01:27.921 --> 00:01:30.456 line:0%
Oh, man! You can put,
like, chicken in it.

00:01:30.456 --> 00:01:34.026 line:0%
-I'm Australian. I'm Australian.
-I know! I know!

00:01:34.026 --> 00:01:36.662 line:0%
[ Buzzer ]
Okay.

00:01:36.662 --> 00:01:37.930 line:0%
Oh, my God! Oh, my God!

00:01:37.930 --> 00:01:40.332 line:0%
-Quesadilla?
-It was a quesadilla.

00:01:40.332 --> 00:01:43.702 line:0%
I am so sorry!
A taco on the side.

00:01:43.702 --> 00:01:46.038 line:0%
-A taco on the side.
-Wow! I am so sorry.

00:01:46.038 --> 00:01:47.573 line:0%
-Wow.
-That's all right.

00:01:47.573 --> 00:01:49.742 line:0%
-I'm surprised you didn't get it
from "taco on the side."

00:01:49.742 --> 00:01:51.243 line:0%
-That's all right, boo.
We gonna get it.

00:01:51.243 --> 00:01:52.978 line:0%
-All right. Here we go.
That was great, buddy.

00:01:52.978 --> 00:01:54.514 line:0%
All right. Here we go.

00:01:54.514 --> 00:01:55.748 line:0%
[ Beeping ]

00:01:55.748 --> 00:01:59.952 line:0%
Okay, uh, not long pants.

00:01:59.952 --> 00:02:01.621 line:0%
-Short pants. Short shorts.
-Yes!

00:02:01.621 --> 00:02:04.623 line:0%
-Yeah! Whoo!

00:02:04.623 --> 00:02:08.360 line:0%
-Okay, an exercise move
where you go to here.

00:02:08.360 --> 00:02:09.795 line:0%
-Squats!
-There you go!

00:02:09.795 --> 00:02:12.265 line:0%
-Yeah!
-All right.

00:02:12.265 --> 00:02:15.734 line:0%
-They're a type of shoe and --
-Clogs.

00:02:15.734 --> 00:02:17.470 line:0%
Crocs.
-Yeah! Yeah!

00:02:17.470 --> 00:02:20.506 line:0%
-What?!
-Who is this guy?

00:02:20.506 --> 00:02:22.641 line:0%
-Okay, we're not --
When you like something,

00:02:22.641 --> 00:02:24.444 line:0%
you're giving it some applause,
but not fast.

00:02:24.444 --> 00:02:26.212 line:0%
You're going to do it...
-Slow clap.

00:02:26.212 --> 00:02:28.614 line:0%
-Yeah!
-Wow!

00:02:28.614 --> 00:02:30.683 line:0%
-"Always after me..."

00:02:30.683 --> 00:02:33.886 line:0%
It's a cereal.
It's a little leprechaun.

00:02:33.886 --> 00:02:36.288 line:0%
It's a cereal with all sorts of
different marshmallows in it.

00:02:36.288 --> 00:02:37.756 line:0%
-Oh, Lucky Charms!
-Yes!

00:02:37.756 --> 00:02:39.291 line:0%
[ Buzzer ]

00:02:39.291 --> 00:02:41.594 line:0%
Yes! We won that one, too!
-No!

00:02:41.594 --> 00:02:43.562 line:0%
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:02:43.562 --> 00:02:45.798 line:0%
We were on fire!
We were on fire!

00:02:45.798 --> 00:02:46.966 line:0%
-He cheated.

00:02:46.966 --> 00:02:49.034 line:0%
At one moment, I thought
you were looking over.

00:02:49.034 --> 00:02:50.369 line:0%
Kind of looked like
you saw his card.

00:02:50.369 --> 00:02:51.737 line:0%
-I never did that.

00:02:51.737 --> 00:02:53.573 line:0%
-I'm gonna have to side with --
I felt that, as well.

00:02:53.573 --> 00:02:55.975 line:0%
-Guys, we're going to play
one more round.

00:02:55.975 --> 00:02:57.076 line:0%
-One more round.

00:02:57.076 --> 00:02:59.378 line:0%
-And this one is worth
10,000 points.

00:02:59.378 --> 00:03:00.980 line:0%
Whoever wins this
wins the whole game.

00:03:00.980 --> 00:03:02.715 line:0%
-Here we go.
-All right, focus up, buddy.

00:03:02.715 --> 00:03:04.016 line:0%
-All or nothing.
-Here we go.

00:03:04.016 --> 00:03:05.518 line:0%
Let's start with you, Liam.
-All right. We got this.

00:03:05.518 --> 00:03:07.320 line:0%
-Here we go. Ready?
-Yeah.

00:03:07.320 --> 00:03:08.954 line:0%
[ Beeping ]

00:03:08.954 --> 00:03:11.490 line:0%
-Um, God. I'm not cold.
-Hot.

00:03:11.490 --> 00:03:12.925 line:0%
-Yep, okay. First word.

00:03:12.925 --> 00:03:14.326 line:0%
Next part -- I'm all...

00:03:14.326 --> 00:03:16.195 line:0%
-Wet. Dry. Sad. Slow.

00:03:16.195 --> 00:03:19.065 line:0%
-I'm a hot -- Ugh!
-A hot dude. Hot guy?

00:03:19.065 --> 00:03:20.333 line:0%
You're a hot guy.

00:03:20.333 --> 00:03:21.634 line:0%
-It's all --
Everything's everywhere.

00:03:21.634 --> 00:03:23.469 line:0%
-Everything's messy. Hot mess!

00:03:23.469 --> 00:03:26.105 line:0%
-Hot mess!
-Yeah! There, go.

00:03:26.105 --> 00:03:28.274 line:0%
[ Beeping ]

00:03:28.274 --> 00:03:30.376 line:0%
[ Laughter ]

00:03:30.376 --> 00:03:32.311 line:0%
-I don't even know the word.
-What?

00:03:32.311 --> 00:03:36.816 line:0%
-Can I pass?
-No, you can't pass!

00:03:36.816 --> 00:03:40.085 line:0%
-I don't know.
-What are you talking about?

00:03:40.085 --> 00:03:43.890 line:0%
-I just don't know. It's long.
It's an instrument.

00:03:43.890 --> 00:03:47.193 line:0%
-Australian instrument.
-Australian instrument.

00:03:47.193 --> 00:03:49.228 line:0%
-It's a didgeridoo!
-Yes!

00:03:49.228 --> 00:03:52.064 line:0%
-What?!
-I knew it!

00:03:52.064 --> 00:03:56.735 line:0%
-Oh! Use the force, you must!

00:03:56.735 --> 00:03:58.103 line:0%
[ Buzzer ]

00:03:58.103 --> 00:03:59.772 line:0%
-Oh, that's it.
There, we got it.

00:03:59.772 --> 00:04:03.042 line:0%
Didgeridoo. We won.

00:04:03.042 --> 00:04:04.744 line:0%
Wow. Didgeridoo.

00:04:04.744 --> 00:04:08.647 line:0%
-What are the rules of that?
Oh, God.

00:04:08.647 --> 00:04:11.984 line:0%
I'm, like, mad.
-Our thanks to Liam Hemsworth,

00:04:11.984 --> 00:04:14.554 line:0%
Jessica Williams,
Rob Gronkowski.

